The documentation consists of three documents, and of course the manual
page (which is the Appendix to the User's Manual).

ml1tut.pdf	- the ML/I Tutorial. New users should read this first.
ml1sig.pdf	- the ML/I Simple Introductory Guide. This builds on the
		  Tutorial and should be read next.
ml1user.pdf	- the ML/I User's Manual. This contains more advanced
		  examples, and also serves as a reference.
ml1appy.pdf	- Appendix Y to the ML/I User's Manual. This contains
		  details specific to the FreeBSD implementation.

